  "details": "At some point the eye tracking debug visuals stopped showing up when the worn avatar’s eye tracking control state switches to animated. This works fine if the avatar doesn’t not have eye tracking support, but ironically avatars with eye tracking support can no longer see the debug visuals. \n\nRepro is easy: Turn on the eye debug visuals and switch to any avatar with vrcft support and enable eye tracking in the AM.",
